SUMMARY:Meet the Mowers
DTSTAMP:20260716T055641Z
DTSTART:20260807T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Free\, Members onlyNo registration necessaryAll ages \n\n\n\nHo
	uston Arboretum Members are the G.O.A.T! This Members-only appreciation ev
	ent is designed as a relaxed\, drop-in experience. Members can observe the
	 goats while enjoying the Trail Mix Grazing Station\, a self-serve snack s
	tation with assorted trail mix ingredients\, and informal engagement with 
	staff and volunteers. \n\n\n\nAlthough petting is not allowed\, you’ll hav
	e plenty of chances to capture fun selfies with our furry visitors before 
	they embark on their next adventure! \n\n\n\n\nbecome a member\n\n\n\n\n\n
	\n\n\nThis event will be held rain or shine and will be entirely outdoors.
	 Please dress for the weather.\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/meet-
	the-mowers/\n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
URL:https://houstonarboretum.org/event/meet-the-mowers/
